  "job_B1.6.3_20251001_193255": {
    "text": "Isaias se witega awrat on his witegunge be \u00f0am halgan gaste and be his seofonfealdum gifum.\n\u00dea seofonfealdan gifa synd \u00feus gehatene: sapientia on leden, \u00fe\u00e6t is wisdom on englisc; intellectus on\n\u00deas seofonfealdan gifa so\u00f0lice wunodon on urum h\u00e6lende Criste eall be fullum \u00feingum \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re\nSe man h\u00e6f\u00f0 wisdom, \u00fee wislice leofa\u00f0; and se h\u00e6f\u00f0 andgit, \u00fee hit awent to gode and to his drihtnes\nAnd se h\u00e6f\u00f0 godne r\u00e6d, \u00fee him ger\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00e6fre, hw\u00e6t him to donne sy and hw\u00e6t to forl\u00e6tenne.\nAnd se h\u00e6f\u00f0 modes streng\u00f0e, \u00fee micel m\u00e6g forberan and on eallum earfo\u00f0nyssum \u00e6fre bi\u00f0 ge\u00f0yldig\nAnd se h\u00e6f\u00f0 god ingehyd, \u00fee godnysse lufa\u00f0 and bi\u00f0 betera wi\u00f0innan, \u00feonne he wi\u00f0utan bi\u00f0 gesewen,\nSe h\u00e6f\u00f0 arf\u00e6stnysse, \u00fee arf\u00e6st bi\u00f0 him sylf and m\u00e6\u00f0e cann on mannum on his modes godnysse, ge on\nGodes ege is seo seofo\u00f0e \u00feissa gastlicra gifa, and seo gifu is anginn ealles wisdomes, and se \u00f0e godes\nSe man, \u00fee bi\u00f0 bed\u00e6led eallum \u00feissum gifum, nis he na godes mann ne to gode ne belimp\u00f0, butan he\nNu h\u00e6f\u00f0 se yfela gast and se ungesewenlica feond seofonfealde ungifa wi\u00f0err\u00e6de \u00feissum gifum, \u00fea he\n\u00dea yfelan ungifa \u00fe\u00e6s arleasan deofles syndon \u00feus gehatene on ledenspr\u00e6ce; insipientia, \u00fe\u00e6t is dysig\n\u00c6lc wisdom is of gode, for\u00f0am \u00fee god sylf is wisdom, and \u00e6lc man bi\u00f0 eadig, \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00feone wisdom,\nSe wisdom is halig, \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gastes gifu, and se deofol forgif\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6rtogeanes dysig, \u00fe\u00e6t he wisdomes\nOngean \u00feam andgyte se deofol forgif\u00f0 stuntnysse, and eac \u00fe\u00e6t he hiwige, swylce he andgitful sy.\nOngean \u00feam wislican r\u00e6de se wi\u00f0err\u00e6da deofol syl\u00f0 receleasnysse his under\u00feeoddum and eac, \u00fe\u00e6t he\nOngean \u00fe\u00e6s modes streng\u00f0e se manfulla deofol forgif\u00f0 abro\u00f0ennysse, \u00fe\u00e6t se man abreo\u00f0e on \u00e6lcere\nOngean \u00feam ingehyde se hetela deofol syle\u00f0 nytennysse nahtlicum mannum, and eac \u00fe\u00e6t hy hiwigon,\nOngean \u00fe\u00e6re arf\u00e6stnysse he syl\u00f0 arleasnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t he ne arige ne eac ne m\u00e6\u00f0ige his under\u00feeoddum ne\nOngean godes ege se gramlica deofol syle\u00f0 dyrstignysse mid dw\u00e6slicum geb\u00e6rum receleasum mannum\nBe \u00f0isum \u00feeawum man m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6ne man tocnawan, hw\u00e6\u00f0er him godes gast on wunige o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s",
